    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Automating the Deep Space Network Data Systems; A Case Study in Adaptive Anomaly Detection through <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> AI
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chou%2C+E+J">Evan J. Chou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Locke%2C+L+S">Lisa S. Locke</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Soldan%2C+H+M">Harvey M. Soldan</a>
      
