        GDS <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> for Graph Algorithmic Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shi%2C+B">Borun Shi</a>, 
      
