        Validating Generative <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span>-Based Models for Logistics and Supply Chain Management Research
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Castillo%2C+V+E">Vincent E. Castillo</a>
      
