      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.19611">arXiv:2508.19611</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.19611">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2508.19611">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2508.19611">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
        <span class="tag is-small is-link tooltip is-tooltip-top" data-tooltip="Artificial Intelligence">cs.AI</span>
        
          
